blican states, including North Carolina and Virginia, featured; map shown of his upcoming stops. [OBAMA \u2013 campaigns.] [At a charity dinner last night, OBAMA \u2013 jokes.] [Senator Joe BIDEN \u2013 speaks to young people.]  \n\n(Washington: Andrea Mitchell) Obama\u2019s funding advantage over McCain featured; scenes shown of McCain in Florida; details given of the pulling of advertising for McCain in Michigan and Wisconsin and the restrictions on McCain because he took federal money; Obama ad within a video game and clip from \u201cSaturday Night Live\u201d shown. [Campaign Media Analysis Group Evan TRACEY&#134;- notes Obama\u2019s advantage is forcing McCain to defend home turf.]  \n\n(Studio: Brian Williams) The release of Cindy McCain\u2019s tax return information noted. ", "segment_duration": 420, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63060.0", "legacy_segment_id": 921695, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "a3CXgb5upy", "broadcast_date": "2008-10-17", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1690, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 921694, "segment_id": "FZv0rD7e48", "segment_broadcast_id": "a3CXgb5upy", "segment_title": "Making Your Vote Count (Ohio Voter Fraud Case)", "segment_description": "(Studio: Brian Williams) The Supreme Court decision barring Ohio Republicans from challenging the eligibility of new voters reported. ", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63480.0", "legacy_segment_id": 921696, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": n